{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Dressing the Part"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Proper Suit"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Proper Interview Attire"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "First impressions are important in the workplace. When you go for a job interview, it is important that you are well prepared and that you look your best."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In North America, the way you dress at a job interview can be a deciding factor of if you are successful or not."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some tips about the proper interview attire:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. Dress one or two levels \u201cup\u201d. In other words, dress slightly higher than what is the standard attire for the job you are applying for.  <br>2. Your clothes should be clean and well-cared for. Avoid wearing colors that are too faded and old looking. Avoid wearing colors that are too bright or distracting. Make sure there are no stains or rips.  <br>3. Wear appropriate shoes - and make sure they are clean. <br>4. Have your hair styled neatly. <br>5. Avoid wearing strong smelling perfumes - most workplaces are scent-free. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "If you look the part, it will help you get the part!"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something that will be in progress at a particular time in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> to talk about future events which are:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. expected <br><br> For example:  <br><span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ll be thinking</span> about it all next week.</span>  (You anticipate or expect that you will be thinking about it all next week)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. decided<br><br>For example: <br><span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ll be going</span> shopping all next week as well.</span>  (Based on what happened, you decided you will be going shopping next week)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br>Look at the chart for the structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span>:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + be + v-ing\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be going</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shopping next week.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be getting </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ready for her interview. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "iron"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a heavy instrument with one flat side used to remove wrinkles from clothes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This shirt has a lot of wrinkles, but I don't have an iron."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le13ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and interview attire."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blazer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a suit jacket worn with no matching pants"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The blue shirt is a good idea, but I don't think you should wear a blazer. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le13ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make a good impression"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give a sense of what kind of a person you are based only on appearance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember, you have already made an impression based on how you're dressed before you say a single word to the interviewer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le13ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "matching"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes something that goes well with something else because it has a complementary color or style"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should wear a matching jacket and pants, a dress shirt, a tie, coordinating socks and dress shoes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le13ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dress code"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way people are expected to dress"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: For the interview, you should dress more formally than the company dress code."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le13ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le13ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find an old magazine. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look through it and choose a few outfits that you think would be appropriate for a job interview."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Cut out the outfits and prepare a small poster to display the outfits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your poster with your classmates an