ue shirt and a grey jacket. Could you give me your opinion?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>:  Of course. The blue shirt is a good idea, but I don't think you should wear a blazer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: I thought I would dress a bit more casually this time.<br>", "id": 0}, {"time": "21000", "image": "engenn9le13ob02re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: That's not a good idea. Remember, you have already made an impression based on how you're dressed before you say a single word to the interviewer. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Everyone at their office is dressed casually.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: For the interview, you should dress more formally than the company dress code.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Would you mind helping me choose something else?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: Sure. You need to dress in an appropriate way for the position you are applying for. Usually, this means wearing a suit. You should wear a matching jacket and pants, dress shirt, tie and dress shoes. A dark suit with a light shirt is a good option.<br>", "id": 1}, {"time": "55500", "image": "engenn9le13ob02re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Ok. I think I'll need to buy some new clothes. Could you give me some suggestions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: It would be my pleasure.  You should avoid loud colors and flashy ties. Also, your clothing should be neat, clean, and well pressed.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: I don't have an iron.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: Oh, Adam. Maybe that was your problem at the last interview. I can lend you one, but you should get one of your own. Consider it an investment in your future.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Ok, I guess I'll be going shopping all next week as well!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: It will have been worth buying a few things if you get the job.<br>", "id": 2}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}